---
/**
 * FTC-compliant affiliate disclosure banner.
 * Appears at the top of any page with affiliate links (below H1, above calculator).
 * Not dismissible — FTC requires it to be visible.
 */
---

<div class="bg-neutral-100 border-l-4 border-primary-500 rounded-r-md px-4 py-3 my-4">
  <p class="text-sm text-neutral-700">
    <span class="font-medium">Disclosure:</span> Some links on this page are affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
    <a href="/disclosure" class="text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-700 underline transition-colors duration-150">
      Full disclosure
    </a>
  </p>
</div>
